# Cloudflare static-asset response headers.
#
# Note: when several patterns match a request, Cloudflare merges their headers
# and comma-joins duplicates. Two rules setting Cache-Control on the same path
# would produce an invalid header, so each path gets exactly one rule.
#
# Filenames here are stable step numbers, not content hashes, so re-capturing a
# screenshot reuses the same URL -- caches are kept short on purpose.

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
